<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Mind Sphere</h1>
<p>The spells of the mind sphere work on the mind and the senses: they put foes to sleep, slow, stun, hold, frighten or charm them, blind them with flashes of light, and also make you invisible, let you see through walls or sharpen your focus. Your ability in the sphere decides how well you cast them, and also how well you resist mind spells cast on you (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>). Most of these spells are resisted by the target's brain. Storm gate does nothing at present, because of a known bug.
</p><p>The spells, and who teaches them (guild level):
</p>
<pre>drowse                  sorcerer 25
slow                    sorcerer 9, conjurer 15
stun                    sorcerer 15
hold                    no guild teaches it
invisibility            conjurer 20, assassin 25
wizard eye              conjurer 23
fear                    necromancer 19, dark knight 28
confusion               sorcerer 13
sleep                   necromancer 14
xray vision             sorcerer 17
calm                    healer 12, druid 26, paladin 28
command                 healer 4, necromancer 28
light breath            no guild teaches it
sonic breath            no guild teaches it
hold monster            sorcerer 27
hold undead             necromancer 14, healer 23
storm gate              no guild teaches it
cause cowardly flight   no guild teaches it
cause panic             necromancer 42
hold flight             no guild teaches it
hold animal             ranger 17
charm animal            druid 15, ranger 25
locate animal           ranger 9, druid 19
petrify                 druid 30
focus                   conjurer 12
flash                   healer 28
colourbeam              healer 45
colourspray             healer 75
flashing grip           healer 115
mire                    dark knight 18
</pre>
<p>Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
